<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A10.SS7.SSS0.Px5" title="In J.7 Empirical evidence for variation in 𝑚 ‣ Appendix J Theoretical analysis of TRECs ‣ Predicting Training Re-evaluation Curves Enables Effective Data Curriculums for LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">WSD vs. Cyclic LR schedules.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A10.SS7.SSS0.Px6" title="In J.7 Empirical evidence for variation in 𝑚 ‣ Appendix J Theoretical analysis of TRECs ‣ Predicting Training Re-evaluation Curves Enables Effective Data Curriculums for LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Different <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="m^{\ast}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m^{\ast}</annotation></semantics></math> for different learning rate schedules.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
